msgid "Media Studio's library is busy. Try Free up space again in a moment"
msgstr "คลังของ Media Studio ไม่ว่าง ลองเพิ่มพื้นที่ว่างอีกครั้งในอีกสักครู่"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Media Studio's models and images are in Blender's Asset Browser and asset shelves under Angelo Media Studio and drag into a scene like any asset. The library keeps compressed model copies (about 40% of each model); Media Studio shows their size and can turn the library off or free up the space."
